/ Le panneau de la carte du jour (epic #348, phase 3) : qui est dans ce gîte ou
  cette salle au jour choisi. Il vit dans la même Turbo Frame que la fiche d'un
  objet ; « Modifier le tracé » y charge la fiche d'édition.
= turbo_frame_tag "feature_panel" do
  div[class="pointer-events-auto flex h-full flex-col bg-white shadow-2xl md:rounded-xl md:border md:border-stone-200"
      data-feature-panel="true"
      data-venue-panel="true"
      data-feature-id=@feature.id]
    .flex.items-center.gap-2.border-b.border-stone-100.px-4.py-3
      span class="rounded-full bg-ember-tint px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ember"
        | Carte du jour
      h2.flex-1.truncate.text-sm.font-semibold.text-stone-800
        = @venue&.name || @feature.name(:fr).presence || "Objet sans nom"
      button[type="button" class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-stone-400 hover:bg-stone-100 hover:text-stone-700"
             data-action="click->map#closePanel" aria-label="Fermer le panneau"]
        svg.h-5.w-5 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
          line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"
          line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"

    .flex-1.overflow-y-auto.px-4.py-4
      p.text-xs.font-medium.text-stone-500 = l(@date, format: "%A %-d %B %Y").upcase_first

      - case @venue
      - when Lodging
        - groups = @occupancy.lodging_groups(@venue)
        - if groups.any?
          ul.mt-3.space-y-3
            - groups.each do |group|
              = render "map_venues/lodging_group", group: group, venue: @venue
        - else
          = render "map_venues/free", next_label: "Prochain séjour", next_item: @occupancy.next_lodging_booking(@venue)
      - when Space
        - groups = @occupancy.space_groups(@venue)
        - if groups.any?
          ul.mt-3.space-y-3
            - groups.each do |group|
              = render "map_venues/space_group", group: group
        - else
          = render "map_venues/free", next_label: "Prochaine réservation", next_item: @occupancy.next_space_booking(@venue)
      - else
        p.mt-3.rounded-lg.border.border-dashed.border-stone-300.px-3.py-3.text-sm.text-stone-500
          | Cet objet n'est relié à aucun gîte ni aucune salle : reliez-le pour voir son occupation.

    .border-t.border-stone-100.px-4.py-3
      = link_to "Modifier le tracé et la liaison", map_feature_path(@feature),
                class: "text-xs font-medium text-stone-500 hover:text-forest"
